## MainActivity.java Ke Mut متعلقہ Maloomat

Aapke `MainActivity.java`[cite: 1] code mein layouts pehle se hi dynamic tareeqay se (`MATCH_PARENT`, `WRAP_CONTENT` aur weight `1f` ke sath) banaye gaye hain[cite: 1]:

* Is wajah se Java code mein mazeed koi tabdeeli karne ki zarurat nahi hai. 
* Jab aap phone ko rotate karenge, toh table, list, quiz aur settings ke views apni jagah par barkarar rehte hue khud ko landscape mode ke mutabiq automatically adjust kar lenge.
